      50.82,
      476.68,
      286.62,
      606.14
    ],
    "text": "My No.: WAB/LND/09/03. I, hereby give notice under Sub - section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands Servitude which is required for a public purpose to conduct Samurdhi Community Based Bank, Wanduramba.",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      1.9800000190734863,
      7.019999980926514,
      9.0,
      10.020000457763672,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.82,
      606.04,
      227.81,
      625.2
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      1.0199999809265137,
      1.9800000190734863,
      4.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.82,
      625.07,
      286.64,
      706.74
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of Land depicted in the preliminary plan bearing Cadastral Plan No. 810457 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 190, Panvila, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Wanduramba, District of Galle Southern Province. The details of the allotment of land is as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      1.0199999809265137,
      6.0,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.5,
      443.47,
      539.98,
      600.73
    ],
    "text": "Name of the Land: Panvila Hena alias Henakanda Waththa; Description: Home Garden, Two permanent buildings and a water tank; Extent: 0.0479 Hectare. All persons interested in the aforesaid land on which servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat, Wanduramba on the 29th day of July 2024 at 9.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 22nd day of July 2024 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation and the details of the said land/ servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      318.78,
      600.59,
      523.0,
      633.42
    ],
